---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Sobre"
  description="Conheca mais sobre Ricardo Gonzales e a proposta do blog Fe & Filosofia."
  ogImage="/og-images/default-og.svg"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="hero-glow"></div>
    <div class="container hero-content">
      <span class="page-badge">
        <img src="/public/favicon.svg" alt="Badge" class="badge-icon" />
        SOBRE
      </span>
      <h1 class="page-title">Sobre o <span class="accent">Projeto</span></h1>
      <p class="page-sub">
        Um espaco para dialogo entre a Fé Catolica e a Filosofia, com Reflexões
        para a Vida Cotidiana.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-photo-card">
          <img
            src="/ricardo-gonzales.png"
            alt="Foto de Ricardo Gonzales"
            class="about-photo"
            width="325"
            height="450"
          />
        </div>

        <article class="about-content">
          <h2>Ricardo Gonzales</h2>
          <p>
            Este blog nasceu do desejo de compartilhar conteudos que unam
            profundidade intelectual e vivencia espiritual, sempre com linguagem
            acessivel e fiel ao pensamento catolico.
          </p>
          <p>
            Aqui voce encontra artigos, meditacoes e analises sobre temas de fe,
            filosofia, moral e cultura, com foco em formar consciencias e
            fortalecer a caminhada cristã.
          </p>
          <p>
            A proposta e oferecer um ambiente serio e acolhedor para quem busca
            verdade, sentido e crescimento interior.
          </p>
          <a href="/contato" class="btn-about">Entrar em contato →</a>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="about-cards">
        <article class="about-card">
          <div class="info-icon">
            <img src="/fe.svg" alt="" />
          </div>
          <h3>Missao</h3>
          <p>Evangelizar com clareza, unindo fe, razao e formacao intelectual.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="about-card">
          <div class="info-icon">
            <img src="/cruz.svg" alt="" />
          </div>
          <h3>Frequencia</h3>
          <p>Publicacoes frequentes com reflexoes praticas para a vida crista.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="about-card">
          <div class="info-icon">
            <img src="/filosofia.svg" alt="" />
          </div>
          <h3>Comunidade</h3>
          <p>Um espaco de encontro para quem busca verdade e crescimento interior.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    position: relative;
    background: #0e0d0c;
    color: #f0ede8;
    padding: 5rem 0 3.5rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -40%);
    width: 700px;
    height: 500px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(246, 87, 0, 0.12) 0%, rgba(246, 87, 0, 0.04) 40%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .page-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    background: rgba(246, 87, 0, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(246, 87, 0, 0.25);
    padding: 0.45em 1.2em;
    border-radius: 50px;
  }

  .badge-icon {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    display: block;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .accent { color: var(--color-accent); }

  .page-sub {
    max-width: 560px;
    color: #9a9997;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-section {
    padding: 4rem 0;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 373px 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about-photo-card {
    background: var(--color-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 1.4rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: fit-content;
  }

  .about-photo {
    width: 325px;
    height: 450px;
    max-width: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 14px;
    border: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    background: var(--color-bg);
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease;
  }

  .about-photo:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px) scale(1.02);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(246, 87, 0, 0.35);
    border-color: #ff7a33;
  }

  .about-content h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.8rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .about-content p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .btn-about {
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0.8em 1.6em;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  }

  .btn-about:hover {
    background: #d74800;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(246, 87, 0, 0.35);
  }

  .about-cards {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .about-card {
    background: var(--color-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1.4rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  }

  .about-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px var(--color-shadow);
  }

  .info-icon {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: var(--color-accent-subtle);
    border-radius: 10px;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .info-icon img {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    display: block;
  }

  .about-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-card p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .about-photo-card {
      justify-self: center;
      width: 325px;
      max-width: 100%;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .about-cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
